{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>battle of wits and deception</strong>! Every word you say can decide the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this thrilling game with friends, <strong>no one can be trusted</strong>. Only sharp deduction and persuasive skills will lead you to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start, regular players receive a <strong>secret keyword</strong>, but the <strong>Liar</strong> does not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regular players must describe the keyword <strong>without revealing too much</strong>, ensuring the Liar remains unaware.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meanwhile, the <strong>Liar</strong> must carefully listen, deduce the keyword, and blend in. Act too obvious, and you'll be caught. Stay convincing, but don\u2019t overplay your hand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you the <strong>detective</strong> who will expose the Liar, or the <strong>master deceiver</strong> who outsmarts everyone?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the <strong>ultimate psychological battle</strong> now!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3555700?t=1743473967","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3555700?t=1743473967","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555700/db6d6413c394a780284ebfdcc50a4904cdf006fc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743473967","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555700/db6d6413c394a780284ebfdcc50a4904cdf006fc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743473967","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>battle of wits and deception</strong>! Every word you say can decide the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this thrilling game with friends, <strong>no one can be trusted</strong>. Only sharp deduction and persuasive skills will lead you to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start, regular players receive a <strong>secret keyword</strong>, but the <strong>Liar</strong> does not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regular players must describe the keyword <strong>without revealing too much</strong>, ensuring the Liar remains unaware.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meanwhile, the <strong>Liar</strong> must carefully listen, deduce the keyword, and blend in. Act too obvious, and you'll be caught. Stay convincing, but don\u2019t overplay your hand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you the <strong>detective</strong> who will expose the Liar, or the <strong>master deceiver</strong> who outsmarts everyone?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the <strong>ultimate psychological battle</strong> now!</p>","developers":["Kark Project"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555700/header.jpg?t=1743473967","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13 High Sierra \uc774\uc0c1<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 (4th Gen) / Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel Iris Plus Graphics / AMD Radeon Pro 555<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11 Big Sur \uc